@* Portal navigation.
   A COORDINATOR sees Dashboard, Students and Enroll Students — their enrolment is scoped to the
   students they added, both in the roster shown and in the server-side placement check. Payments
   & Invoices and Coordinators remain principal-only: each of those pages carries its own
   [Authorize] gate, and the links are wrapped so a coordinator is not shown a link that would
   only 403 them. The AuthorizeView is presentation, NOT the control: every gate is on the page
   and, for enrolment, again in SchoolEnrollmentService. *@
<nav class="account-nav">
    <NavLink href="/school" Match="NavLinkMatch.All" class="account-nav__link">Dashboard</NavLink>
    <NavLink href="/school/students" class="account-nav__link">Students</NavLink>
    <NavLink href="/school/enrollment" class="account-nav__link">Enroll Students</NavLink>
    <AuthorizeView Roles="school_principal">
        <NavLink href="/school/billing" class="account-nav__link">Payments &amp; Invoices</NavLink>
        <NavLink href="/school/coordinators" class="account-nav__link">Coordinators</NavLink>
    </AuthorizeView>
</nav>
